# Run linters after edits

After making code changes, run the linter for the side you touched before considering
the work done. Fix any failures you introduced.

| Side | Paths | Command (from that directory) |
|------|-------|-------------------------------|
| Frontend | `client/**` | `cd client && bun run lint` |
| Backend | `server/**` | `cd server && uv run lint` |

## Rules

- If you edited both sides in one turn, run **both** commands.
- Do not skip lint because the change was "small" or "just formatting".
- If lint fails, fix the issues and re-run until clean.
- README / docs-only edits do not require these linters.
